{
  "extends": "./shared.json",
  "ci": {
    "collect": {
      "url": [
        "http://localhost:3200/",
        "http://localhost:3200/products",
        "http://localhost:3200/products/tuck-end-box",
        "http://localhost:3200/articles/choosing-box-paper",
        "http://localhost:3200/faq",
        "http://localhost:3200/styles",
        "http://localhost:3200/styles/pk-te-01-%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%AD%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9D%E0%B8%B2%E0%B9%80%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%B5%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%9A-%E0%B8%9B%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%9D%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%99-%E0%B8%A5%E0%B9%88%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B9%84%E0%B8%94%E0%B9%89"
      ],
      "numberOfRuns": 3,
      "settings": {
        "preset": "desktop",
        "throttlingMethod": "simulate",
        "extraHeaders": {
          "Cookie": "pk_consent=a1m1"
        }
      }
    },
    "assert": {
      "assertions": {
        "resource-summary:script:size": [
          "error",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 270000
          }
        ],
        "categories:seo": [
          "error",
          {
            "minScore": 0.9
          }
        ],
        "largest-contentful-paint": [
          "warn",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 2000
          }
        ],
        "cumulative-layout-shift": [
          "warn",
          {
            "maxNumericValue": 0.05
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "$comment": "Marketing, catalogue and product pages: LCP <= 2.0s, initial JS <= 150 KB (docs/performance-budgets.md). RATCHET: the target in docs/performance-budgets.md is 150 KB of initial JS; this build measures 256–257 KB (F3 3.1; 374 KB in F1.3), so the assertion is pinned just above the current figure. It stops the number growing while the gap is worked down — it is not the budget. Lower the ceiling whenever a change wins headroom; never raise it without saying why in docs/PROGRESS.md."
}
